---
// Member Highlight — video-led editorial member testimonial (Innovia recruitment page).
// Ported from the AGP design handoff v5 (worked example: Landmarc, Fredericksburg VA).
// Uses the global BaseLayout chrome (SiteHeader/SiteFooter) — no bespoke header/footer here.
// Demo data; per-member accent set as the default in member-highlight.css.
import "../styles/tokens.css";
import "../styles/site.css";
import "../styles/member-highlight.css";
import "../styles/member-highlight-page.css";
---

  <section class="v-hero" id="top">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="crumb-wrap">
        <div class="mh-crumb">
          <a href="/">Innovia</a><span>/</span>
          <a href="/member-spotlights">Members</a><span>/</span>
          <span class="here">Landmarc</span>
          <span class="verified">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
            Verified Innovia member
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="v-hero-grid">
      <div class="v-hero-text">
      <div class="eyebrow on-accent hero-eyebrow"><span class="rule-mini"></span>Why we joined Innovia</div>
      <h1>&ldquo;The co-op gave us a national's muscle &mdash; <em>without making us sell our company</em> to get it.&rdquo;</h1>
      <div class="cite">Tom Brennan &middot; Founder &amp; President, Landmarc</div>
      </div><!-- /v-hero-text -->

      <!-- ===== VIDEO CENTERPIECE =====
           Swap the .poster-slot + .play markup for an <iframe> (YouTube/Vimeo)
           or a <video poster="…"> when the interview file is ready. -->
      <div class="v-stage-wrap">
        <div class="v-stage" id="videoStage" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Play member interview">
          <div class="poster-slot">
            <img src="/assets/photos/landmarc-interview.jpg" alt="Interview with Tom Brennan, founder of Landmarc" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 26%;">
          </div>
          <div class="play">
            <svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="caption">
            <div class="av" style="background-image:url(/assets/photos/landmarc-interview.jpg);background-size:cover;background-position:50% 22%;"></div>
            <div>
              <div class="ttl">Why we joined Innovia</div>
              <div class="sub">Tom Brennan, Founder &amp; President &middot; Landmarc</div>
            </div>
            <span class="runtime">4:12</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      </div><!-- /v-hero-grid -->
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ STATS ============ -->
  <section class="v-substats tight">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="intro">
        <img class="intro-logo" src="/assets/logos/landmarc-white.png" alt="Landmarc">
        <div class="intro-badge">
          <img src="/assets/logos/innovia-white-green.png" alt="Innovia Co-op">
          <span>Member since <b>2018</b></span>
        </div>
        <p class="intro-text">Landmarc is an independent community-management firm in <b>Fredericksburg, Virginia</b>, caring for HOA and condominium associations across the Rappahannock region since 2009.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mh-stats">
        <div class="s"><span class="v">16<span class="u">yrs</span></span><span class="k">Independent &amp; growing</span></div>
        <div class="s"><span class="v">140<span class="u">+</span></span><span class="k">Communities managed</span></div>
        <div class="s"><span class="v">48</span><span class="k">On the team</span></div>
        <div class="s"><span class="v">9</span><span class="k">Localities served</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ STORY ============ -->
  <section class="v-story">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="head">
        <div class="eyebrow on-accent"><span class="rule-mini"></span>The story</div>
        <h2>Built one Virginia community at a time.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <div class="col">
          <p class="drop">Landmarc started in 2009 with a single self-managed HOA outside Fredericksburg and a founder who was tired of watching national roll-ups treat local communities like spreadsheet rows. The pitch was simple: a manager who actually lives here, answers the phone, and shows up at the annual meeting.</p>
          <p>That stubborn locality became the company's edge. While competitors chased volume across state lines, Landmarc grew by referral — board president to board president — across Fredericksburg, Stafford, and Spotsylvania.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col">
          <p>By 2018, the firm faced the question every successful independent eventually does: sell to a national for the resources, or stay independent and fall behind on buying power. Joining Innovia made it a false choice.</p>
          <p>Today, 48 team members manage 140+ communities with co-op-negotiated vendor pricing behind every budget — and the same founder still personally onboards every new association.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pull">
          <p>"We didn't want to sell to a national. We wanted their leverage <em>without their leash.</em> The co-op was the answer."</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ FOUNDER ============ -->
  <section class="v-founder">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="frame">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="av" style="background-image:url(/assets/photos/landmarc-interview.jpg);background-size:cover;background-position:50% 20%;"></div>
          <div class="nm">Tom Brennan</div>
          <div class="rl">Founder &amp; President</div>
          <div class="creds"><span>CMCA</span><span>AMS</span><span>PCAM</span></div>
          <div class="card-facts">
            <div class="cf"><span class="cf-k">Top credential</span><span class="cf-v">PCAM</span></div>
            <div class="cf"><span class="cf-k">Industry board</span><span class="cf-v">CAI · Central Virginia</span></div>
            <div class="cf"><span class="cf-k">At the co-op</span><span class="cf-v">Mid-Atlantic vendor council</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="copy">
          <div class="eyebrow on-accent"><span class="rule-mini"></span>Leadership</div>
          <h3>The person behind the firm — and the interview.</h3>
          <p>Tom founded Landmarc after a decade managing master-planned communities across the Rappahannock region. He holds the PCAM — the industry's highest management credential — and sits on the Central Virginia chapter board of CAI. Under him, the firm has never lost a community to a competitor on service.</p>
          <p>He brought the company into Innovia in 2018, and now represents the Mid-Atlantic region on the co-op's vendor council. Hear him tell it in the interview above.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="accred">
        <div class="accred-head">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow on-accent"><span class="rule-mini"></span>Accreditations &amp; standing</div>
            <h4>Credentialed at the firm, not just the desk.</h4>
          </div>
          <p>Beyond Tom's personal designations, Landmarc holds company-level accreditation and is a verified member in good standing of the Innovia cooperative.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="accred-grid">
          <div class="cred">
            <svg class="seal" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"/><path d="M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11"/></svg>
            <div class="ac">AAMC</div>
            <div class="fn">Accredited Association Management Company — CAI's highest firm designation</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cred">
            <svg class="seal" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
            <div class="ac">CAI</div>
            <div class="fn">Community Associations Institute member — Central Virginia Chapter</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cred">
            <svg class="seal" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"/><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7z"/><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
            <div class="ac">Licensed &amp; bonded</div>
            <div class="fn">Registered and bonded in the Commonwealth of Virginia</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cred is-innovia">
            <svg class="seal" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 7a4 4 0 1 1-8 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"/><path d="M12 14v8"/><path d="M9 19h6"/></svg>
            <div class="ac">Innovia Verified</div>
            <div class="fn">Member in good standing of the Innovia co-op since 2018</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ COMMUNITIES ============ -->
  <section class="v-comm">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="head">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow on-accent"><span class="rule-mini"></span>Growth, with the co-op behind it</div>
          <h2>Membership that fuels growth and expansion.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Co-op pricing and benchmarking let us bid sharper and protect margin &mdash; so we win more communities and keep them. The roster below is the proof, spanning single-family, condo, and active-adult associations region-wide.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="cell"><div class="nm">Estates at Lee's Hill</div><div class="meta">Fredericksburg · 312 doors · since 2012</div><div class="type">Single-family HOA</div></div>
        <div class="cell"><div class="nm">Leeland Station</div><div class="meta">Stafford · 540 doors · since 2014</div><div class="type">Master-planned community</div></div>
        <div class="cell"><div class="nm">Celebrate Virginia</div><div class="meta">Fredericksburg · 280 doors · since 2016</div><div class="type">Condominium association</div></div>
        <div class="cell"><div class="nm">Falls Run</div><div class="meta">Fredericksburg · 1,150 doors · since 2017</div><div class="type">55+ active adult</div></div>
        <div class="cell"><div class="nm">Harrison Crossing</div><div class="meta">Spotsylvania · 196 doors · since 2019</div><div class="type">Townhome / PUD</div></div>
        <div class="cell"><div class="nm">Cosner's Corner</div><div class="meta">Spotsylvania · 168 doors · since 2021</div><div class="type">Mixed-use condominium</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

